OL,3,GNEWSANetwork 'a celebration of black
OL,4,Asuccess every day'
OL,5,
OL,6,FAfter struggling to find a network for
OL,7,Fblack entrepreneurs, a Manchester-based
OL,8,Fbusinessman said he decided to start
OL,9,Fhis own.
OL,11,FDavid Chipfupa moved from Berkshire
OL,12,Ffour years ago for a change of
OL,13,Flifestyle.
OL,15,FBut the 37-year-old said working
OL,16,Fremotely in technology sales soon left
OL,17,Fhim feeling professionally isolated.
OL,23,APub: 19-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB NW Eng NewsC Reg TVF Weather
FL,410,400,260,160,0,100
