OL,3,GNEWSANetwork 'a celebration of black
OL,4,Asuccess every day'
OL,5,
OL,6,F"I didn't really see a space where
OL,7,Fblack professionals could network," he
OL,8,Fsaid. "There were events but there
OL,9,Fwasn't really a community in
OL,10,FManchester. Now our community is a
OL,11,Fcelebration of black success and black
OL,12,Fexcellence every day."
